[{"id":"Njk-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Analisis unsur suatu asam menunjukkan bahwa persen massa unsur penyusun molekul asam tersebut adalah 5,89% H, 70,6% C, and 23,5% O. Bila berat molekul asam tersebut adalah 136 g/mol, bagaimana formula molekulnya?</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"C_6H_{16}O_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_6H_%7B16%7DO_3\" />","<img alt=\"C_7H_4O_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_7H_4O_3\" />","<img alt=\"C_8H_8O_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_8H_8O_2\" />","<img alt=\"C_9H_{12}O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_9H_%7B12%7DO\" />","<img alt=\"C_9H_{16}O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_9H_%7B16%7DO\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQzNg"},{"id":"Njk-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Untuk mendapatkan gas nitrogen dioksida (<img alt=\"NO_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_%7B2%7D\" />), anda mereaksikan dua gas tak&nbsp;dikenal (gas A dan B). Dengan menggunakan data yang anda peroleh, anda dapat menuliskan persamaan reaksi setara sbb:</p><p><img alt=\"2A_{(g)} + B_{(g)}\\rightarrow 2NO_{2(g)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2A_%7B%28g%29%7D%20&amp;plus;%20B_%7B%28g%29%7D%5Crightarrow%202NO_%7B2%28g%29%7D\" /></p><p>Bila anda mulai dengan 8 L gas A dan 3 L gas B, Berapa liter gas <img alt=\"NO_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_%7B2%7D\" /> yang akan anda peroleh ? (anggaplah semuanya dalam keadaan s.t.p.)</p>","choices":["2L","3L","4L","6L","8L"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQzNw"},{"id":"Njk-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>10 g parafin, <img alt=\"C_{20}H_{42}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B20%7DH_%7B42%7D\" />, suatu zat terlarut yang tak mudah menguap, dilarutkan dalam 50 g benzen, <img alt=\"C_{6}H_{8}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B8%7D\" />. Pada suhu 53&deg;C, tekanan uap murni benzen adalah 300 torr.&nbsp;Tekanan uap Iarutan pada suhu tersebut adalah</p>","choices":["298 torr","292 torr .","284 torr","275 torr","267 torr"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQzOA"},{"id":"Njk-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Larutan pekat asam klorida, HCI, adalah Iarutan 36% w/w HCI dalam air. Larutan ini memiliki rapat massa 1,18 g/<img alt=\"cm^{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?cm%5E%7B3%7D\" />. Konsentrasi Iarutan tersebut adalah</p>","choices":["1,2 M .","12 M","24 M","30 M","7 M"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQzOQ"},{"id":"Njk-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Molalitas senyawa para-diklorobenzena (<img alt=\"C_{6}H_{4}CI_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B4%7DCI_%7B2%7D\" />) dalam suatu Iarutan yang dibuat dengan cara melarutkan 2,65 g <img alt=\"C_{6}H_{4}CI_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B4%7DCI_%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp; dalam 50 mL benzena (kerapatan = 0,879&nbsp;g/mL) adalah:</p>","choices":["0,018 m","0,041 m","0,180 m","0,410 m","1,810 m"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0MA"},{"id":"Njk-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dengan menggunakan data berikut ini :</p><p><img alt=\"N_{2}(g)+ 30_{2}(g)+H_{2}(g)\\rightarrow 2HNO_{3}(aq)\\mid \\Delta H=-414.8 kJ\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_%7B2%7D%28g%29&amp;plus;%2030_%7B2%7D%28g%29&amp;plus;H_%7B2%7D%28g%29%5Crightarrow%202HNO_%7B3%7D%28aq%29%5Cmid%20%5CDelta%20H%3D-414.8%20kJ\" /></p><p><img alt=\"N_{2}O_{5}(g)+H_{2}O(g)\\rightarrow 2HNO_{3}(aq) \\mid \\Delta H=218.4 kJ\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_%7B2%7DO_%7B5%7D%28g%29&amp;plus;H_%7B2%7DO%28g%29%5Crightarrow%202HNO_%7B3%7D%28aq%29%20%5Cmid%20%5CDelta%20H%3D218.4%20kJ\" /></p><p><img alt=\"2H_{2}O_{(g)\\rightarrow 2H_{2}(g)+O_{2}(g) \\mid \\Delta H= 483.6\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2H_%7B2%7DO_%7B%28g%29%5Crightarrow%202H_%7B2%7D%28g%29&amp;plus;O_%7B2%7D%28g%29%20%5Cmid%20%5CDelta%20H%3D%20483.6\" /></p><p>Tentukan&nbsp; untuk reaksi :</p><p><img alt=\"2N_{2}O_{5}\\rightarrow 2N_{2}(g) + 5O_{2}(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2N_%7B2%7DO_%7B5%7D%5Crightarrow%202N_%7B2%7D%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%205O_%7B2%7D%28g%29\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","choices":["149.6 kJ","90.8 kJ","-876.4 kJ","782.8 kJ","1750 kJ"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0MQ"},{"id":"Njk-q07","number":7,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu isotop atom&nbsp;<img alt=\"^{23}Mg\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5E%7B23%7DMg\" />&nbsp;mempunyai muatan +2. Jumlah Proton, Neutron dan elektron yang di milikinya adalah :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191122141820.PNG\" style=\"height:190px; width:350px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0Mg"},{"id":"Njk-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini pereakasi manakah bila di campur dan di panaskan dengan ammonium sulfat, membebaskan ammonia ?</p>","choices":["Akua bromin","asam hidroklorida encer","air kapur","asam nitrit","kalium di kromat ( VI ) diasamkan"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0Mw"},{"id":"Njk-q09","number":9,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Mengenai Ion f<img alt=\"e^{+3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?e%5E%7B&amp;plus;3%7D\" />&nbsp;,manakah konfigurasi elektron boks dari sub kulit 3d yang bener&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191122153235.PNG\" style=\"height:79px; width:133px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0NA"},{"id":"Njk-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Atom atom berikut ini, manakah yang mempunyai energi ionisasi&nbsp; kedua yang paling besar ?</p>","choices":["AI","Mg","Ca","Ti","Na"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0NQ"},{"id":"Njk-q11","number":11,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jumlah elektron valensi yang terdapat dalam ion oksalat&nbsp;<img alt=\"C_{2}O_{4^{2-}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B2%7DO_%7B4%5E%7B2-%7D%7D\" />&nbsp;,&nbsp; adalah:</p>","choices":["&nbsp;2","10","32","34","44"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0Ng"},{"id":"Njk-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dari persamaan berikut ini, manakah yang merupakan reaksi oksidasi-reduksi ?</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"2HCI(aq) + Mg(s)\\rightarrow MgCI_{2}(aq)+H_{2}(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2HCI%28aq%29%20&amp;plus;%20Mg%28s%29%5Crightarrow%20MgCI_%7B2%7D%28aq%29&amp;plus;H_%7B2%7D%28g%29\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"Na_{2}O(s)+ H_{2}O(I)\\rightarrow 2NaOH(aq)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Na_%7B2%7DO%28s%29&amp;plus;%20H_%7B2%7DO%28I%29%5Crightarrow%202NaOH%28aq%29\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"CO_{2}(g) + H_{2}O(I)\\rightarrow H_{2}CO_{3}(aq)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CO_%7B2%7D%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20H_%7B2%7DO%28I%29%5Crightarrow%20H_%7B2%7DCO_%7B3%7D%28aq%29\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"CaO(s)+ SO_{3}(g)\\rightarrow CaSO_{4}(s)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CaO%28s%29&amp;plus;%20SO_%7B3%7D%28g%29%5Crightarrow%20CaSO_%7B4%7D%28s%29\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"NH_{3}(g) + HCI(g)\\rightarrow NH_{4}CI(s)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B3%7D%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20HCI%28g%29%5Crightarrow%20NH_%7B4%7DCI%28s%29\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0Nw"},{"id":"Njk-q13","number":13,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dari pernyataan berikut ini, manakah pernyataan yang benar untuk menjelaskan sifat sifat yang dikaitkan dengan ikatan ionik dan kovelen ?</p>","choices":["Senyawa kovalen tidak dapat membentuk suatu elektrolit.","Senyawa kovalen dengan titik leleh tinggi hanya terjadi bila terdapat ikatan&nbsp;","beberapa senyawa kovelen yang mengadung oksigen dan hidrogen dalam kolekulnya dapat membentuk ikatan hidrogen&nbsp;","&nbsp; Ikatan ionik dan ikatan kovalen keduanya tidak dapat terjadi dalam suatu senyawa yang sama&nbsp;","Senyawa ionik berbeda dari logam dimana senyawa ionik tidak menghantar listrik dalam keadaan padat&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0OA"},{"id":"Njk-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu reaksi kimia eksotermik berlangsung dalam dua tahap reaksi,</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191122162244.PNG\" style=\"height:40px; width:438px\" /></p><p>Energi aktivasi tahap 1 adalah 50 kJ.mol<img alt=\"^{-1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5E%7B-1%7D\" />.Bedasarkan data tersebut, manakah diagram yang menggambarkan diagram tingkat energi untuk reaksi ini ?&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191122162444.PNG\" style=\"height:194px; width:393px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ0OQ"},{"id":"Njk-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Arus listrik 0,0965 A dialirkan ke dalam 50 mL larutan NaCI 0,1 M selama 1000 detik, maka konsentrasi OH dalam larutan adalah&nbsp;</p>","choices":["0,0005 M","&nbsp;0,0010&nbsp;M","&nbsp;0,0020&nbsp;M","&nbsp;0,0100&nbsp;M","&nbsp;0,0200&nbsp;M"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ1MA"},{"id":"Njk-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Elektrolisis Larutan CuS<img alt=\"O_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?O_%7B4%7D\" />&nbsp;dengan elektroda platina menggunakan arus 1A selama 965 detik, Berat Cu yang mengendap pada katoda adalah...</p>","choices":["3,175 g","0,03175 g","0,0635 g","0,3175 g","31,75 g"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ1MQ"},{"id":"Njk-q17","number":17,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu gas senyawa organik, X di bakar dengan oksigen berlebihan sebanyak 0,112&nbsp;<img alt=\"dm^{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?dm%5E%7B3%7D\" />&nbsp;sampel X diukur pada s.t.p mengasilkan 0,88 g karbon dioksida.Berapa banyak atom karbon yang terdapat dalam suatu molekul senyawa X ini ?</p>","choices":["1","2","3","4","8</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzQ1Mg"},{"id":"Njk-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa berikut ini, manakah yang mempunyai titik didih paling tinggi:","choices":["<img alt=\"CH_3CH_2CH_2CH_2CH_2CH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_3CH_2CH_2CH_2CH_2CH_3\" />","<img alt=\"CH_3CH_2OH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_3CH_2OH\" />","<img alt=\"CH_3CH_2CH(OH)CH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_3CH_2CH%28OH%29CH_3\" />","<img alt=\"CH_3CH_2(CH_2)_2CHO\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_3CH_2%28CH_2%29_2CHO\" />","<img alt=\"CH_3(CH_2)_5OH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_3%28CH_2%29_5OH\" /><br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0NzE"},{"id":"Njk-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dari kelima senyawa organik tersebut dibawah ini, bawah ini manakah yang paling benar tatanamanya ?","choices":["2-kloro-5metil-5-heksena","&nbsp;2-metil-1-pentena-4-ol","3-etil-2-metil-2-pentena","2-metil-2-heksana-4-ol","2,3-dimetisikloheksena<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0NzI"},{"id":"Njk-q20","number":20,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa radikal bebas dibawah ini, manakah yang paling stabil ?<br /> A <img alt=\"CH_3.\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_3.\" /><br /> B. <img alt=\"(CH_3)_2CH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28CH_3%29_2CH\" /><br /> C. <img alt=\"(CH_3)_3C\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28CH_3%29_3C\" /><br /> D. <img alt=\"C_2H_5\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_2H_5\" /><br /> E. <img alt=\"(CH_3)_2CHCH_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28CH_3%29_2CHCH_2\" /><br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0NzM"},{"id":"Njk-q21","number":21,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Tentukan urutan kereaktifan dari senyawa turunan asam karboksilat berikut:<br /> 1. Asetamida<br /> 2. Asetil klorida<br /> 3. Etil asetat<br /> 4. Anhidrida asam asetat</p>","choices":["1&gt;2&gt;3&gt;4","2&gt;1&gt;3&gt;4","3&gt;4&gt;3&gt;1","2&gt;4&gt;3&gt;1","4&gt;3&gt;2&gt;1"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0NzQ"},{"id":"Njk-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Semua senyawa berikut adalah merupakan isomer dari butanon, kecuali?</p>","choices":["t-butil eter","Tetrahidro furan","2,3-epoksibutan","&nbsp;Etil vinyl eter&nbsp;","1,2-butenol"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0NzU"},{"id":"Njk-q23","number":23,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Manakah dari senyawa berikut yang tidak menunjukkan isomer cis trans ?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201009094717.PNG\" style=\"height:205px; width:260px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0NzY"},{"id":"Njk-q24","number":24,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dengan menggunakan pereaksi grignard di bawah ini senyawa manakah yang dapat menghasilakn&nbsp;<img alt=\"CH_3CH_2CH(OH)CH_2CH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_3CH_2CH%28OH%29CH_2CH_3\" />&nbsp;?</p>","choices":["Metil etiketon dan metil Grignard","Propanon dan metil Grignard","Butil Grignard dan asetal dehida","Etil Grignard dan Propionaldehida","Krotonaldehida dan Grignard</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0Nzc"},{"id":"Njk-q25","number":25,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi esterifikasi asam karboksilat dengan alkilhalida dalam suasana basa akan mengasilkan akhir adalah...</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201009095149.PNG\" style=\"height:165px; width:234px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0Nzg"}]
